(The success of this Equipment Marketplace Tech platform, predicated on becoming the "default decision) Tj
T* (platform," hinges entirely on trust. Our Security and Compliance Architecture is designed not merely as a) Tj
T* (defensive measure but as a core feature, protecting proprietary data \(pricing, TCO models\) and highly) Tj
T* (sensitive user/partner information \(lead intent, financial data\).) Tj
ET
