(A. Data Encryption and Protection) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 607.0077165354330191 Td
(•  Data-in-Transit: All communication between users, partners \(dealers, financiers\), and the platform) Tj
T* (utilizes mandatory TLS 1.2+ encryption \(HTTPS\). We enforce HSTS \(HTTP Strict Transport Security\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 581.7077165354330646 Td
(•  Data-at-Rest: All production databases \(including the proprietary "data moat" containing real quotes,) Tj
T* (TCO inputs, and ownership feedback\) are encrypted using AES-256 standards \(e.g., AWS KMS or Azure) Tj
T* (Key Vault\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 543.7577165354330191 Td
(•  Tokenization/Anonymization: Sensitive personally identifiable information \(PII\) and financial data \(e.g.,) Tj
T* (specific dealer quotes, individual user shortlists\) are tokenized or pseudonymized before being used in) Tj
T* (large-scale AI training models or aggregated data products.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 505.8077165354330305 Td
(•  Secret Management: API keys, database credentials, and internal service accounts are managed via a) Tj
T* (dedicated secret management service, rotated regularly, and never stored in application code) Tj
T* (repositories.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. 0.435 0.902 rg
42.5196850393700814 456.5191338582676508 Td
(B. Identity and Access Management \(IAM\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 432.5305511811023393 Td
(•  Principle of Least Privilege: Access to production environments, databases, and internal analytics) Tj
T* (dashboards is strictly controlled based on job function. Developers only access what is necessary for) Tj
T* (their tasks.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 394.5805511811023507 Td
(•  Multi-Factor Authentication \(MFA\): Mandatory MFA for all internal employees, administrators, and) Tj
T* (external partner portals \(dealers accessing lead dashboards\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 369.2805511811023393 Td
(•  Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\): Granular controls defining what specific partner roles \(e.g., Dealer) Tj
T* (Sales Manager vs. Finance Head\) can view, ensuring finance data is isolated from sales lead data.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 343.980551181102328 Td
(•  API Security: Implement OAuth 2.0 and API Gateway throttling/rate limiting to protect against DDoS) Tj
T* (attacks and unauthorized data scraping, particularly on the price intelligence endpoints.) Tj
